    <briefdescription>
<para>Immutable snapshot of all sampler parameters used for one inference call. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stored alongside <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1_a_i_decision_audit" kindref="compound">AIDecisionAudit</ref></computeroutput> to enable post-hoc audit and replay.</para>
<sect1 id="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1_l_l_m_inference_parameter_snapshot_1autotoc_md7_1s1"><sect2 id="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1_l_l_m_inference_parameter_snapshot_1autotoc_md7">
<title>Invariants</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1_l_l_m_inference_parameter_snapshot_1a017b303aaaff72d80f936fb9e7907208" kindref="member">mode</ref> == Deterministic</computeroutput> implies <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1_l_l_m_inference_parameter_snapshot_1a98d1b531e51614c4020ff24cb4770789" kindref="member">temperature</ref> == 0.0f &amp;&amp; <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1_l_l_m_inference_parameter_snapshot_1a7386c74b21320661afa5286ede1209ef" kindref="member">top_k</ref> == 1 &amp;&amp; rng_seed.has_value()</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1_l_l_m_inference_parameter_snapshot_1a017b303aaaff72d80f936fb9e7907208" kindref="member">mode</ref> == Audit</computeroutput> implies <computeroutput>rng_seed.has_value()</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>All float values are finite (no NaN/Inf). </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
